rld and instead of the war in ukraine  reducing the importance of other issues  on the forum's agenda it has made them  more urgent  the need to provide energy supplies from  outside russia has been discussed ceos  from exin and total energies renewed  their commitment to stop investing in  russia even if that might increase the  cost of energy  john kerry the us envoy for climate  change made the link between the fight  for the environment and the priority to  stop the current war in ukraine  it is the worst thing i've seen  and i fought in a war but it's the worst  thing i've seen  since i've seen clips of what happened  in world war ii  and it really rises to a level of  bestiality and personal craveness  that all of us should be  pushing back against in every way that  we possibly know  other how being covered in the forum  include the questions of refugees  misinformation and the war for truth  women's rights post pandemic business  models and artificial intelligence  mohammed al jazeera
 

